    "detailed_description": "<h1>Early Access Roadmap</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1683380/extras/234c8e50b422e6493a88c35b7a124867.avif?t=1745483344\" /></div></p></p><br><h1>Contact Us</h1><p>Please send us email if you have any feedback or questions.  \ud83d\udc49 <a href=\"mailto:pupuproject@sina.com\">pupuproject@sina.com</a></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Welcome to PuPu's Adventure Park! </h2></strong><br>Here's what you need to know about this &quot;PARK&quot;...<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1683380/extras/93ab8e3e87773ffe2928355e58e3cef6.poster.avif?t=1745483344\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1683380/extras/93ab8e3e87773ffe2928355e58e3cef6.webm?t=1745483344\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1683380/extras/93ab8e3e87773ffe2928355e58e3cef6.mp4?t=1745483344\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>In a not-so-far planet called MoeStar, a long established peace between all clans was disrupted when the Dark Goblins acquired a mysterious &quot;summoning&quot; power, leading to their dominance over the other clans.<br><br>One of the long-suffering clans, the PuPu clan, out of desperation and destitution as their life source depletes, are forced to sign a lease from the Goblins to run one of their businesses on the planet. <br><br>The PuPu clan set up shop on this new lease - an Adventure Park - attracting &quot;heroes&quot; who are summoned through the Goblin's powers to pay a visit. The PuPu Adventure Park is meant to be an unforgettable adventure for the heroes, while the PuPu clan works hard to build park facilities to satisfy park visitors!<br><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">As the PuPu clan and Park leader, you'll have full control of the Park operations, the employees (other PuPus) and the facilities: </h2></strong><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1683380/extras/4bc0bf5174bfcc38bffecdac73ed7833.avif?t=1745483344\" /></div><br>Staffing and assigning the most &quot;capable&quot; PuPu to run newly-built facilities. The more you make your customers (&quot;heroes&quot;) SWEAT from activities, the more you gain as resources to continue running and expanding the Park. <br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1683380/extras/1cdc688bc40a1f4268e9b02a59906857.poster.avif?t=1745483344\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1683380/extras/1cdc688bc40a1f4268e9b02a59906857.webm?t=1745483344\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1683380/extras/1cdc688bc40a1f4268e9b02a59906857.mp4?t=1745483344\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>   <br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1683380/extras/0c8745cfd37ae396dd5ae280c1a1165d.avif?t=1745483344\" /></div><br>Design your park by catering to the customers (&quot;heroes&quot;); the Park's offerings will be listed on a mission board where different customers (&quot;heroes&quot;) will come for different demands. Make sure you build a wide range of missions to get the most out of them - including rare items and hero elements, used to upgrade your Park!<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1683380/extras/bd4dfef7989bb5a66c52bf0cdb9f2afb.poster.avif?t=1745483344\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1683380/extras/bd4dfef7989bb5a66c52bf0cdb9f2afb.webm?t=1745483344\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1683380/extras/bd4dfef7989bb5a66c52bf0cdb9f2afb.mp4?t=1745483344\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div> <br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1683380/extras/aa3af9fdbad1b5fce1a71a0267f17618.avif?t=1745483344\" /></div><br>From special facilities like the Weapons Shop, the Groceries and the Tailor's, to special customers (&quot;heroes&quot;) like poets, merchants and even bounty hunters...make sure you keep unlocking facilities from the Blueprint to expand the Park. You might also stumble upon some surprising stories in this Park...<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1683380/extras/17a566f06ad9c8454951608f6c853360.poster.avif?t=1745483344\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1683380/extras/17a566f06ad9c8454951608f6c853360.webm?t=1745483344\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1683380/extras/17a566f06ad9c8454951608f6c853360.mp4?t=1745483344\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>  <br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1683380/extras/09afc920232525781b76144d68581df3.avif?t=1745483344\" /></div><br>With the expansion of the Park, you will need more &quot;employees&quot;! You will be able to breed more PuPu through the Spring of Life. Grow them and feed them through building houses, cookie machines, and bakeries etc. (Yep, they have a sweet tooth!), you will also have to soothe their mood sometimes. <br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1683380/extras/4ce32641fb585d28a77d0b1d1293c93c.poster.avif?t=1745483344\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1683380/extras/4ce32641fb585d28a77d0b1d1293c93c.webm?t=1745483344\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1683380/extras/4ce32641fb585d28a77d0b1d1293c93c.mp4?t=1745483344\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1683380/extras/c48bc13c066ee4986b0482c396ee6d65.avif?t=1745483344\" /></div><br>Don't forget why you're here - ultimately you want to revive the God of PuPu clan so that it brings back the mysterious power of the Spring of Life...the source of PuPu's well-being. But first... You'll need to slave the days away by running your lease from Goblin's Park and survive. <br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1683380/extras/dd1241d5a4149d5bcaa1e5da055b0b59.poster.avif?t=1745483344\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1683380/extras/dd1241d5a4149d5bcaa1e5da055b0b59.webm?t=1745483344\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1683380/extras/dd1241d5a4149d5bcaa1e5da055b0b59.mp4?t=1745483344\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
