he more you make your customers (&quot;heroes&quot;) SWEAT from activities, the more you gain as resources to continue running and expanding the Park. <br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1683380/extras/1cdc688bc40a1f4268e9b02a59906857.poster.avif?t=1745483344\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1683380/extras/1cdc688bc40a1f4268e9b02a59906857.webm?t=1745483344\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1683380/extras/1cdc688bc40a1f4268e9b02a59906857.mp4?t=1745483344\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>   <br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1683380/extras/0c8745cfd37ae396dd5ae280c1a1165d.avif?t=1745483344\" /></div><br>Design your park by catering to the customers (&quot;heroes&quot;); the Park's offerings will be listed on a mission board where different customers (&quot;heroes&quot;) will come for different demands. Make sure you build a wide range of missions to get the most out of them - including rare items and hero elements, used to upgrade your Park!<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1683380/extras/bd4dfef7989bb5a66c52bf0cdb9f2afb.poster.avif?t=1745483344\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1683380/extras/bd4dfef7989bb5a66c52bf0cdb9f2afb.webm?t=1745483344\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1683380/extras/bd4dfef7989bb5a66c52bf0cdb9f2afb.mp4?t=1745483344\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div> <br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamsta